{"2117420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Prime Horror II", "steam_appid": 2117420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prime Horror II</strong> is a multiplayer 8-page-style horror game with a comedic twist. In this 4v1 player-versus-player experience, you can play on either side of the warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the nefarious <strong>Joe Bozo</strong>, whose sole purpose is to hunt down every last worker before they escape. Or team up with your friends and use your wits, a trusty flashlight, and a healthy disregard for each other's safety to make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive by collecting every package, our take on the classic eight-page objective, or gather matches and burn all of Joe Bozo's cult totems to extinguish him once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break some ankles and teabag your way to victory. Do whatever it takes to survive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prime Horror II</strong> is a multiplayer 8-page-style horror game with a comedic twist. In this 4v1 player-versus-player experience, you can play on either side of the warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the nefarious <strong>Joe Bozo</strong>, whose sole purpose is to hunt down every last worker before they escape. Or team up with your friends and use your wits, a trusty flashlight, and a healthy disregard for each other's safety to make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive by collecting every package, our take on the classic eight-page objective, or gather matches and burn all of Joe Bozo's cult totems to extinguish him once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break some ankles and teabag your way to victory. Do whatever it takes to survive.</p>", "short_description": "A comedic 4v1 8 page horror game.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full aud